{section:features title='Everything a page needs', eyebrow='Features'}
  Built in, written as tags - nothing to install, nothing to configure.
  {section:item 'Fast', icon='zap'}Pages render in milliseconds, and the page cache keeps them.{/section:item}
  {section:item 'Safe', icon='shield-check'}Every value is text: a field never runs as code.{/section:item}
  {section:item 'Plain', icon='code'}HTML with a few braces - a designer reads it at a glance.{/section:item}
  {section:item 'Data', icon='database'}Rows from SQL, JSON, YAML or CSV, looped by name.{/section:item}
  {section:item 'Forms', icon='check-circle'}Rules on the fields, checked on the server and in the browser.{/section:item}
  {section:item 'Charts', icon='bar-chart'}Inline SVG from the same rows, light and dark.{/section:item}
{/section:features}
